@party
title: Party Affairs
card-image: img/Vorwaerts_nr_1.png
is-deck: true

- #party_affairs

@govt
title: Government Affairs
# Gated behind holding some real institutional power (House, Senate, or the
# presidency) rather than the original's flat "time >= 6" - a government
# affairs deck about legislating shouldn't unlock on a fixed timer if we're
# still in total opposition. Once we hold ANY chamber or the White House,
# there is something to legislate/negotiate over.
view-if: dem_house = 1 or dem_senate = 1 or dem_president = 1
card-image: img/reichstag_2.jpg
is-deck: true

- #govt_affairs
